# MT5 Strategy Tester output (2026-08-30). Every headless run drops an .htm report plus
# its .png charts; a single court writes dozens. 328 of them were sitting untracked and
# VS Code's git extension re-scans the lot on every poll — which is what made console
# windows flash across the screen all week. Same reasoning as dist/ above: regenerable
# by re-running the court, and the numbers that matter are quoted in the daily reports.
mt5/_tester_runs/
